# Supabase config for the self-serve profile feature (claims + self-edit).
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your project's values.
# Both are safe to expose in the browser — the anon key is public by design;
# Row-Level Security (supabase/schema.sql) is what protects the data.
#
# Find these in Supabase → Project Settings → API.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# On Vercel, set the same two vars in:
#   Project → Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview), then redeploy.
